    "updated_at": "2020-08-12T22:49:42Z",
    "body": "> is there a status on vendor interest/adoption or technical challenges with the proposal?\r\n\r\nCSS modules, along with JSON modules, is blocked on this security concern around using MIME type to determine module type: https://github.com/w3c/webcomponents/issues/839\r\n\r\nWe're working on driving this proposal in TC39 to resolve this concern: https://github.com/tc39/proposal-import-assertions.\r\n\r\nWhen that proposal advances in TC39, I expect that the integration of CSS modules to HTML will resume.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
