    "updated_at": "2021-06-25T22:26:11Z",
    "body": "I've brought this up-to-date with changes from review feedback on the [import assertions PR](https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/5883) and [JSON modules PR](https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/5658).\r\n\r\nTo my knowledge, the remaining issues blocking this PR are:\r\n- Resolve https://github.com/tc39/proposal-import-assertions/issues/27 in TC39 on whether to add restrictions for hosts on behavior for unrecognized module types in an import assertion. This wouldn't be a significant behavior change for this PR -- HTML will reject unknown module types anyway -- but it could require an additional hook in the import assertions integration.\r\n- Stop referencing `CSSStyleSheet` interface methods directly in this PR. I'll fix this as soon as https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/pull/6411 lands.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
